{"seq":2,"slug":"rego-language-basics","title":"Rego 语言基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/opa-rego/rego-language-basics","wordCount":1168,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"rego-语言基础\">Rego 语言基础</h1><p>Rego 是 OPA 使用的声明式策略语言，专门为策略推理设计。它基于 Datalog 逻辑编程语言的思想，扩展了对 JSON/YAML 等结构化数据的原生支持。理解 Rego 的语法和思维模型，是编写有效策略的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h2 id=\"rego-的思维模型\">Rego 的思维模型</h2><p>Rego 与传统命令式编程语言有本质区别。在 Rego 中，你不是在描述&quot;如何计算&quot;，而是在描述&quot;什么为真&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 命令式思维&#10;        A[输入数据] --&gt; |一步步操作| B[遍历每个元素]&#10;        B --&gt; C[检查条件]&#10;        C --&gt; D[返回结果]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 声明式思维&#10;        E[输入数据] --&gt; |声明规则| F[什么条件下&lt;br/&gt;结果为真]&#10;        F --&gt; G[引擎自动推导]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 命令式思维\n        A[输入数据] --&gt; |一步步操作| B[遍历每个元素]\n        B --&gt; C[检查条件]\n        C --&gt; D[返回结果]\n    end\n    subgraph 声明式思维\n        E[输入数据] --&gt; |声明规则| F[什么条件下&lt;br/&gt;结果为真]\n        F --&gt; G[引擎自动推导]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>命令式（Python/Go）</th>\n<th>声明式（Rego）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>关注点</td>\n<td>如何计算</td>\n<td>什么为真</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制流</td>\n<td>显式循环/条件</td>\n<td>隐式逻辑推导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变量</td>\n<td>可变赋值</td>\n<td>不可变绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>求值顺序</td>\n<td>由代码顺序决定</td>\n<td>由引擎优化决定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>关键转变：</strong> 写 Rego 策略时，不要想&quot;我要遍历这个列表然后检查&quot;，而是想&quot;存在某个元素满足这些条件&quot;。这种思维转变是掌握 Rego 的关键。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"基本语法结构\">基本语法结构</h2><p>一个 Rego 策略文件由 package 声明、import 语句和规则定义组成。</p>\n<h3 id=\"package-和-import\">Package 和 Import</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"package kubernetes.admission&#10;&#10;import data.kubernetes.namespaces&#10;import future.keywords.if&#10;import future.keywords.in\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>package kubernetes.admission</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import data.kubernetes.namespaces</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import future.keywords.if</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import future.keywords.in</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li><code>package</code> 定义策略的命名空间，对应 OPA 数据路径中的 <code>data.kubernetes.admission</code></li>\n<li><code>import</code> 引入其他包或数据，避免在规则中写完整路径</li>\n<li><code>future.keywords</code> 引入新版语法特性（推荐始终引入 <code>if</code> 和 <code>in</code>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"规则定义\">规则定义</h3><p>规则是 Rego 的核心构建块。一条规则声明&quot;在什么条件下，某个值为什么&quot;。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# 完整规则：当条件满足时，allow 为 true&#10;allow if {&#10;    input.request.kind.kind == &quot;Pod&quot;&#10;    input.request.operation == &quot;CREATE&quot;&#10;    container := input.request.object.spec.containers[_]&#10;    startswith(container.image, &quot;registry.example.com/&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 单条件规则的简写形式&#10;is_production if input.request.namespace == &quot;production&quot;&#10;&#10;# 常量规则：始终为指定值&#10;default_replicas := 3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 完整规则：当条件满足时，allow 为 true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>allow if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input.request.kind.kind == \"Pod\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input.request.operation == \"CREATE\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    container := input.request.object.spec.containers[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    startswith(container.image, \"registry.example.com/\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 单条件规则的简写形式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>is_production if input.request.namespace == \"production\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 常量规则：始终为指定值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>default_replicas := 3</span></span></code></pre></div><p>规则的几种形式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则形式</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>完整规则</td>\n<td><code>name if { ... }</code></td>\n<td>多条件组合判断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单条件规则</td>\n<td><code>name if 条件</code></td>\n<td>单个条件的简写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常量规则</td>\n<td><code>name := 值</code></td>\n<td>定义常量值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>默认规则</td>\n<td><code>default name := 值</code></td>\n<td>当无规则匹配时的默认值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"输入与数据\">输入与数据</h2><p>策略评估需要两类信息：<code>input</code>（本次请求的输入）和 <code>data</code>（加载到 OPA 中的静态/半静态数据）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"input\">input</h3><p><code>input</code> 是调用 OPA 时传入的数据，每次评估都不同。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# 访问 input 中的嵌套字段&#10;namespace := input.request.namespace&#10;container_image := input.request.object.spec.containers[0].image&#10;&#10;# 安全访问：字段可能不存在&#10;optional_field := object.get(input.request.object.metadata, &quot;labels&quot;, {})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 访问 input 中的嵌套字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>namespace := input.request.namespace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>container_image := input.request.object.spec.containers[0].image</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 安全访问：字段可能不存在</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>optional_field := object.get(input.request.object.metadata, \"labels\", {})</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"data\">data</h3><p><code>data</code> 是通过 Bundle 或 API 预先加载到 OPA 中的数据，在评估期间不变。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# data 可以是策略（其他包的规则）&#10;allow if data.authz.user_has_role(input.user, &quot;admin&quot;)&#10;&#10;# data 也可以是纯数据（JSON 文件）&#10;allowed_regions := data.config.allowed_regions\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># data 可以是策略（其他包的规则）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>allow if data.authz.user_has_role(input.user, \"admin\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># data 也可以是纯数据（JSON 文件）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>allowed_regions := data.config.allowed_regions</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph OPA 存储&#10;        D[data 树]&#10;        D --&gt; D1[authz.rego → data.authz]&#10;        D --&gt; D2[config.json → data.config]&#10;        D --&gt; D3[rbac.rego → data.rbac]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 评估请求&#10;        I[input&lt;br/&gt;本次请求数据]&#10;    end&#10;    I &amp; D --&gt; E[Rego 引擎评估]&#10;    E --&gt; R[输出结果]\">graph TD\n    subgraph OPA 存储\n        D[data 树]\n        D --&gt; D1[authz.rego → data.authz]\n        D --&gt; D2[config.json → data.config]\n        D --&gt; D3[rbac.rego → data.rbac]\n    end\n    subgraph 评估请求\n        I[input&lt;br/&gt;本次请求数据]\n    end\n    I &amp; D --&gt; E[Rego 引擎评估]\n    E --&gt; R[输出结果]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"变量与绑定\">变量与绑定</h2><p>Rego 中的变量是不可变的。<code>:=</code> 操作符创建绑定（binding），而非赋值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# 变量绑定：name 绑定到满足条件的某个值&#10;name := input.request.object.metadata.name&#10;&#10;# 遍历：_ 是匿名变量，container 依次绑定到每个元素&#10;container := input.request.object.spec.containers[_]&#10;&#10;# 条件绑定：仅当右侧表达式为真时，绑定才成立&#10;admin_user := input.user if input.user.role == &quot;admin&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 变量绑定：name 绑定到满足条件的某个值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>name := input.request.object.metadata.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 遍历：_ 是匿名变量，container 依次绑定到每个元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>container := input.request.object.spec.containers[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 条件绑定：仅当右侧表达式为真时，绑定才成立</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>admin_user := input.user if input.user.role == \"admin\"</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>重要：</strong> 在同一个规则体内，同一个变量名只能绑定一次。如果你需要两个不同的容器进行比较，必须使用不同的变量名。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# 正确：两个不同的变量名&#10;has_image_conflict if {&#10;    c1 := input.spec.containers[_]&#10;    c2 := input.spec.initContainers[_]&#10;    c1.name == c2.name&#10;    c1.image != c2.image&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 错误：同名变量重复绑定&#10;# has_image_conflict_bad if {&#10;#     container := input.spec.containers[_]&#10;#     container := input.spec.initContainers[_]  # 非法！&#10;# }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 正确：两个不同的变量名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>has_image_conflict if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c1 := input.spec.containers[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c2 := input.spec.initContainers[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c1.name == c2.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c1.image != c2.image</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 错误：同名变量重复绑定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># has_image_conflict_bad if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#     container := input.spec.containers[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#     container := input.spec.initContainers[_]  # 非法！</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># }</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"集合与数组操作\">集合与数组操作</h2><p>Rego 对集合和数组的操作是声明式的，不需要显式循环。</p>\n<h3 id=\"集合推导式\">集合推导式</h3><p>集合推导式（Set Comprehension）从满足条件的元素构建一个新集合。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# 收集所有使用了非受信镜像的容器名&#10;untrusted_images := {name |&#10;    container := input.request.object.spec.containers[_]&#10;    name := container.name&#10;    not startswith(container.image, &quot;registry.example.com/&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 收集所有超过资源限制的容器名&#10;overprovisioned := {name |&#10;    c := input.spec.containers[_]&#10;    name := c.name&#10;    c.resources.limits.cpu == &quot;4&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 收集所有使用了非受信镜像的容器名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>untrusted_images := {name |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    container := input.request.object.spec.containers[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name := container.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    not startswith(container.image, \"registry.example.com/\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 收集所有超过资源限制的容器名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>overprovisioned := {name |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c := input.spec.containers[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name := c.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c.resources.limits.cpu == \"4\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"对象推导式\">对象推导式</h3><p>对象推导式构建键值对映射。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# 构建容器名到镜像的映射&#10;container_images := {name: image |&#10;    c := input.spec.containers[_]&#10;    name := c.name&#10;    image := c.image&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 构建容器名到镜像的映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>container_images := {name: image |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c := input.spec.containers[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name := c.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    image := c.image</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"常用内置函数\">常用内置函数</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>count(collection)</code></td>\n<td>计算元素数量</td>\n<td><code>count(input.spec.containers) &gt; 0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>startswith(str, prefix)</code></td>\n<td>检查前缀</td>\n<td><code>startswith(image, &quot;official/&quot;)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>endswith(str, suffix)</code></td>\n<td>检查后缀</td>\n<td><code>endswith(name, &quot;-prod&quot;)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>contains(str, substr)</code></td>\n<td>检查包含</td>\n<td><code>contains(image, &quot;:latest&quot;)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>to_number(str)</code></td>\n<td>字符串转数字</td>\n<td><code>to_number(limit.memory) &gt; 1024</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>object.get(obj, key, default)</code></td>\n<td>安全取值</td>\n<td><code>object.get(labels, &quot;env&quot;, &quot;unknown&quot;)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>json.unmarshal(str)</code></td>\n<td>JSON 解析</td>\n<td><code>json.unmarshal(annotation)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>regex.match(pattern, str)</code></td>\n<td>正则匹配</td>\n<td><code>regex.match(&quot;^v\\\\d+&quot;, tag)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"条件逻辑\">条件逻辑</h2><p>Rego 的条件逻辑通过规则体中的语句和 <code>else</code> 关键字实现。</p>\n<h3 id=\"规则体中的-and-逻辑\">规则体中的 AND 逻辑</h3><p>规则体内的所有语句之间是 AND 关系——全部为真时，规则才为真。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# 所有条件必须同时满足&#10;allow_production_deploy if {&#10;    input.request.operation == &quot;CREATE&quot;&#10;    input.request.namespace == &quot;production&quot;&#10;    container := input.request.object.spec.containers[_]&#10;    not contains(container.image, &quot;:latest&quot;)&#10;    resource_limits_set(container)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 所有条件必须同时满足</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>allow_production_deploy if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input.request.operation == \"CREATE\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input.request.namespace == \"production\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    container := input.request.object.spec.containers[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    not contains(container.image, \":latest\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    resource_limits_set(container)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"or-逻辑-多条同名规则\">OR 逻辑：多条同名规则</h3><p>定义多条同名规则，它们之间是 OR 关系——任意一条为真，整体就为真。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# 满足任一条件即可&#10;allow if {&#10;    input.user.role == &quot;admin&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;allow if {&#10;    input.user.team == input.resource.owner_team&#10;}&#10;&#10;allow if {&#10;    input.request.namespace == &quot;development&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 满足任一条件即可</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>allow if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input.user.role == \"admin\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>allow if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input.user.team == input.resource.owner_team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>allow if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input.request.namespace == \"development\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"else-分支\">else 分支</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"deployment_type := &quot;production&quot; if {&#10;    input.namespace == &quot;prod&quot;&#10;} else := &quot;staging&quot; if {&#10;    input.namespace == &quot;staging&quot;&#10;} else := &quot;development&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>deployment_type := \"production\" if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input.namespace == \"prod\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>} else := \"staging\" if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input.namespace == \"staging\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>} else := \"development\"</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"否定与存在量词\">否定与存在量词</h2><p>Rego 中的否定通过 <code>not</code> 关键字实现，存在量词通过 <code>_</code> 匿名变量实现。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# 否定：不存在满足条件的元素&#10;no_latest_tag if {&#10;    not container_with_latest&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 存在：至少有一个元素满足条件&#10;container_with_latest if {&#10;    c := input.spec.containers[_]&#10;    contains(c.image, &quot;:latest&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 全称量词：所有元素都满足条件&#10;all_containers_have_limits if {&#10;    count(input.spec.containers) &gt; 0&#10;    not container_without_limits&#10;}&#10;&#10;container_without_limits if {&#10;    c := input.spec.containers[_]&#10;    not object.get(c, &quot;resources&quot;, {}).limits&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 否定：不存在满足条件的元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>no_latest_tag if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    not container_with_latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 存在：至少有一个元素满足条件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>container_with_latest if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c := input.spec.containers[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    contains(c.image, \":latest\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 全称量词：所有元素都满足条件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>all_containers_have_limits if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    count(input.spec.containers) > 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    not container_without_limits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>container_without_limits if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c := input.spec.containers[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    not object.get(c, \"resources\", {}).limits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>否定即失败（Negation as Failure）：</strong> Rego 中的 <code>not X</code> 不是&quot;X 为假&quot;，而是&quot;无法证明 X 为真&quot;。这意味着如果数据不完整导致无法评估，<code>not</code> 会返回真。在编写涉及外部数据的否定规则时需要注意这一点。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"一个完整示例\">一个完整示例</h2><p>将以上知识点组合成一个完整的 Kubernetes 准入控制策略。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"package kubernetes.admission&#10;&#10;import future.keywords.if&#10;import future.keywords.in&#10;&#10;# 默认拒绝&#10;default allow := false&#10;&#10;# 允许的条件：所有容器都通过检查&#10;allow if {&#10;    count(violations) == 0&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 收集所有违规&#10;violations contains msg if {&#10;    container := input.request.object.spec.containers[_]&#10;    msg := check_container(container)&#10;    msg != &quot;&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 检查单个容器的所有规则&#10;check_container(container) := msg if {&#10;    contains(container.image, &quot;:latest&quot;)&#10;    msg := sprintf(&quot;容器 %v 使用了 latest 标签&quot;, [container.name])&#10;}&#10;&#10;check_container(container) := msg if {&#10;    not object.get(container.resources, &quot;limits&quot;, {}).memory&#10;    msg := sprintf(&quot;容器 %v 未设置内存限制&quot;, [container.name])&#10;}&#10;&#10;check_container(container) := msg if {&#10;    not startswith(container.image, &quot;registry.example.com/&quot;)&#10;    msg := sprintf(&quot;容器 %v 镜像来自非受信仓库&quot;, [container.name])&#10;}&#10;&#10;check_container(_) := &quot;&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>package kubernetes.admission</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import future.keywords.if</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import future.keywords.in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 默认拒绝</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>default allow := false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 允许的条件：所有容器都通过检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>allow if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    count(violations) == 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 收集所有违规</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>violations contains msg if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    container := input.request.object.spec.containers[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    msg := check_container(container)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    msg != \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 检查单个容器的所有规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>check_container(container) := msg if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    contains(container.image, \":latest\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    msg := sprintf(\"容器 %v 使用了 latest 标签\", [container.name])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>check_container(container) := msg if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    not object.get(container.resources, \"limits\", {}).memory</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    msg := sprintf(\"容器 %v 未设置内存限制\", [container.name])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>check_container(container) := msg if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    not startswith(container.image, \"registry.example.com/\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    msg := sprintf(\"容器 %v 镜像来自非受信仓库\", [container.name])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>check_container(_) := \"\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个示例展示了 Rego 策略的典型结构：默认拒绝 → 定义允许条件 → 收集违规信息 → 具体检查规则。掌握了基础语法后，可以进一步学习<a href=\"rego-advanced-patterns\">Rego 高级模式</a>，包括增量规则、自定义函数和测试模式。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Rego 基础))&#10;    思维模型&#10;      声明式&#10;      描述什么为真&#10;      不可变变量&#10;    语法结构&#10;      package&#10;      import&#10;      规则定义&#10;    输入与数据&#10;      input 请求数据&#10;      data 预加载数据&#10;      安全访问&#10;    集合操作&#10;      集合推导式&#10;      对象推导式&#10;      内置函数&#10;    条件逻辑&#10;      AND 规则体&#10;      OR 多规则&#10;      else 分支&#10;    否定&#10;      not 关键字&#10;      否定即失败&#10;      全称量词模式\">mindmap\n  root((Rego 基础))\n    思维模型\n      声明式\n      描述什么为真\n      不可变变量\n    语法结构\n      package\n      import\n      规则定义\n    输入与数据\n      input 请求数据\n      data 预加载数据\n      安全访问\n    集合操作\n      集合推导式\n      对象推导式\n      内置函数\n    条件逻辑\n      AND 规则体\n      OR 多规则\n      else 分支\n    否定\n      not 关键字\n      否定即失败\n      全称量词模式</pre><ul>\n<li>Rego 是声明式语言，关注&quot;什么为真&quot;而非&quot;如何计算&quot;，这是与命令式语言的核心区别。</li>\n<li>规则由 package、import 和规则定义组成，支持完整规则、单条件规则、常量规则和默认规则四种形式。</li>\n<li><code>input</code> 是每次请求的动态数据，<code>data</code> 是预加载的策略和静态数据，两者共同构成评估的依据。</li>\n<li>集合推导式和对象推导式是声明式遍历和转换数据的核心工具。</li>\n<li>AND 逻辑在规则体内隐式实现，OR 逻辑通过多条同名规则实现。</li>\n<li><code>not</code> 实现否定，遵循&quot;否定即失败&quot;语义；全称量词通过&quot;不存在反例&quot;的模式实现。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Rego 语言基础","id":"rego-语言基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Rego 的思维模型","id":"rego-的思维模型"},{"level":2,"text":"基本语法结构","id":"基本语法结构"},{"level":3,"text":"Package 和 Import","id":"package-和-import"},{"level":3,"text":"规则定义","id":"规则定义"},{"level":2,"text":"输入与数据","id":"输入与数据"},{"level":3,"text":"input","id":"input"},{"level":3,"text":"data","id":"data"},{"level":2,"text":"变量与绑定","id":"变量与绑定"},{"level":2,"text":"集合与数组操作","id":"集合与数组操作"},{"level":3,"text":"集合推导式","id":"集合推导式"},{"level":3,"text":"对象推导式","id":"对象推导式"},{"level":3,"text":"常用内置函数","id":"常用内置函数"},{"level":2,"text":"条件逻辑","id":"条件逻辑"},{"level":3,"text":"规则体中的 AND 逻辑","id":"规则体中的-and-逻辑"},{"level":3,"text":"OR 逻辑：多条同名规则","id":"or-逻辑-多条同名规则"},{"level":3,"text":"else 分支","id":"else-分支"},{"level":2,"text":"否定与存在量词","id":"否定与存在量词"},{"level":2,"text":"一个完整示例","id":"一个完整示例"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"OPA 架构与集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/opa-rego/opa-architecture"},"next":{"title":"Rego 高级模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/opa-rego/rego-advanced-patterns"}}